SUMMARY:Intermediate Ride (C) - LC New Holland Reservoir (39R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, an
 d Ride Together**\n\nRide leader: Aaron Siebert\nAnticipated Average Pace:
  (14-16 mph)\nRoute: [https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/lc-new-holl
 and-reservoir-39r/](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/lc-new-hollan
 d-reservoir-39r/)\n\nThis is an Intermediate C Class ride. The ride leader
  will ride at the advertised average speed. This is intended to be a group
  ride with a no-drop rule as the main goal. The ride leader will do his/he
 r best to keep the group together with occasional regroupings and/or split
 ting into multiple groups to align to pace capabilities.\n\nPlease do not 
 join this ride if you are not willing to ride with the group. If you excee
 d the posted pace\, you will be riding by yourself and encouraged to join 
 a faster group. If maintaining a 14-16 mph average is beyond your current 
 ability level\, please consider joining a slower ride first.\n\nHelmets ar
 e mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare 
 tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a 
 pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP belo
 w to join this ride. Being on Meetup does not mean you are a club member. 
 Join here [Member Signup](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?p
 age_id=60&club_id=257148)\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the c
 lub's Code of Conduct: [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net
 /content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\n\nGuidance if a
 n incident occurs: [Incident Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/conten
 t.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3145422
 56/
