SUMMARY:Jigger Shop Trail Ride 21miles F RSVP Required
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nJigger Shop is OPENED!\nJ
 oin members and friends of the Wilmington and Lancaster club on a trail ri
 de to the world famous Jigger Shop. Sunday\, JMay 17 ride begins at 2pm fr
 om the famous Root Beer Barrel\, route 419 in Cornwall. We will ride the L
 ebanon Valley trail 10 miles toward Elizabethtown\, turning around and rid
 ing back. On our way back\, we will stop in Mt. Gretna at the popular Jigg
 er shop for ice cream/ and or yummy lunch. Helmets are required\; have a t
 ube so someone can fix a flat. Hybrid or Gravel bike recommended. Richard 
 Conner\, leader 717-572-8480\nThis is a casual ride. Please do not sign up
  for this ride unless you are willing to ride at a casual pace and stay wi
 th the group. No one left behind.\nHelmets are mandatory\;\nPlease do not 
 put the leader in an embarrassing situation having to beg someone to wear 
 a helmet\nPlease bring water\, and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire l
 evers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper w
 aiver\, we encourage LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join thi
 s ride. RSVP also allows us to contact you after the ride if needed. If yo
 u do not RSVP you are not covered by the club excess accident insurance po
 licy\; only club members who RSVP are covered. Being on Meetup does not me
 an you are a club member. Join here- https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/con
 tent.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide 
 by the club's Code of Conduct: https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/conten
 t.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984\nRules of the Road: http
 s://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&mo
 dule_id=325159 and\nRide Waiver: https://lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?i
 d=763523
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3146846
 92/
