SUMMARY:IMPROMPTU LI - 2025 CBC 31 mile route
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide Leader: Bruce Black\
 n\nAn enjoyable ride on the 2025 CBC 50 mile route. There is a little clim
 bing on this route. The pace will be 14 - 16 mph average. Multiple regroup
  points as necessary.\n\nThis ride is a social ride\, but cyclists are not
  expected to stay in one group. Cyclists may pedal at their own comfortabl
 e paces. Please be supportive of the other cyclists to avoid anyone biking
  alone or being dropped off the back of the last group.\n\nCue and Ride wi
 th GPS links:\n[2025 CBC 30 mile Lititz Library start](https://ridewithgps
 .com/routes/55162518?privacy_code=pHafKxTEsG11kHsuccmKCczloSYJhzm4)\n\nHel
 mets are mandatory\; please also plan to bring 1-2 water bottles\, and a b
 asic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\nBeing a M
 eetup Member does not mean you are a club member. Use this link to join th
 e club.\n[https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_i
 d=257148](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_i
 d=257148)\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of Cond
 uct [https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=
 257148&module_id=323984](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx
 ?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\nand Rules of the Road\n[http
 s://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?](https://lancbikeclub.clube
 xpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159)
